#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:179
msgid "A floating label sits inside the empty field like a placeholder and moves to the top edge, smaller, as soon as the field is focused or filled. The plugin rebuilds the markup Contact Form 7 renders and ships the stylesheet; your pages need no JavaScript for it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:180
msgid "Text, email, URL, telephone, number and textarea fields get floating labels. Checkboxes, radio buttons, selects, file uploads, quizzes and CAPTCHAs keep their original markup."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:181
msgid "The label text comes from the form template (a <label> that encloses the field or points at its id) or from the placeholder option of the form-tag. A label in the template wins over a placeholder."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:182
msgid "Fields the plugin does not recognise are left exactly as Contact Form 7 renders them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:191
msgid "The settings of this screen apply to every form. Override them per form, per placement or per field; later layers win."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:192
#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:597
msgid "Per form"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:192
#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:598
msgid "Add lines to the \"Additional Settings\" tab of the form:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:194
#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:601
msgid "Per placement"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:194
#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:602
msgid "Select the Contact Form 7 block and open the panel \"Floating Labels\" in the block sidebar; it stores the choice as classes in the \"Class\" field of the block (panel \"Form attributes\"). The same classes work in the html_class attribute of the shortcode, so one form can look different on different pages:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:196
#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:605
msgid "Per field"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:196
#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:606
msgid "Add the option nofloat to the form-tag, before any quoted value:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:206
#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:621
msgid "Colours, sizes and timing are CSS custom properties on the .wpcf7 wrapper. Copy the snippet into Appearance > Customize > Additional CSS or into your child theme and change the values you need; properties you leave out keep their defaults."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:208
#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:622
msgid "To style one form only, replace .wpcf7 with the id of its wrapper, for example [id^=\"wpcf7-f123-\"], or with a class you add through the html_class attribute."
msgstr ""

